Changes made to the source:
- kept only stars at or brighter than the magnitude limit recorded in data/manifest.json, and removed the Sun;
- converted right ascension and declination to a J2000 unit vector;
- kept only apparent magnitude and the B-V color index from the remaining fields;
- stored the result as little-endian float32 records, sorted brightest first.

